==Description==
'''32''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]]. It was obtained at Level 32 in the premium track, which costed {{CandyCorns|1,110 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|94}} ({{Robux|70}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock. It had a total cost of {{CandyCorns|16,690 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|2,616}} ({{Robux|1,964}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases the number 32, with a black and purple gradient. This number has a yellow and white outline around it. Multiple glitch effects can also be seen. It uses the default sticker sound when used, which is a healing sound.

