==Trivia==
*This sticker is a reference to the 32 meme from the Tower Defense Simulator community, which started due to the number of squares initially being thought to be a clue to activation of the [[Hidden Wave]]<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TX-fxLM49qE</ref>.
**This number got referenced multiple times before, such as in the [[v1.32.0]] in-game update log.
*The sound that plays when using the '''32''' sticker originates from the video game ''Undertale''.

